OL,3,AEgyptian authorities arrest motorist   
OL,4,Aover tanker crash that killed 31       
OL,6,FEgyptian authorities have arrested a   
OL,7,Fman accused of causing a tanker crash  
OL,8,Fand massive fire that killed 31 people 
OL,9,Fon a busy Cairo highway.               
OL,11,FThe public prosecutor's office said the
OL,12,Fmotorist had confessed to driving at   
OL,13,F110km/h (68mph) along a section of ring
OL,14,Froad, to the north of the old city     
OL,15,Fcentre, and clipping the tanker with   
OL,16,Fthe side of his car as he changed      
OL,17,Flanes.                                 
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
