OL,3,AEgyptian authorities arrest motorist   
OL,4,Aover tanker crash that killed 31       
OL,6,FSources close to the investigation were
OL,7,Fearlier quoted by state media as saying
OL,8,Fa high-voltage cable had fallen in     
OL,9,Ffront of the fuel truck, causing the   
OL,10,Fdriver to lose control.                
OL,12,FTwenty-one others were injured in the  
OL,13,Fcrash in the Warraq neighbourhood on   
OL,14,FWednesday evening, with hospitals      
OL,15,Ftreating patients for burns and smoke  
OL,16,Finhalation.                            
